{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Three Cardinals</strong> is a short, nonlinear exploration game with rhythm-based character movement. You play as Mother Cardinal and explore 3 distinct regions to find your chicks who all recently moved out of the family nest\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> scenic landscapes inspired by Quebec\u2019s wilderness: from the Northern Cliffs\u2019 golden woods to the Eastern Bay\u2019s rocky beaches\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLY AND SING</strong> using simple controls. Feel like going a little faster? As you fly, press \u201cSpace Bar\u201d to the music\u2019s melody and boost your speed! Later, upgrade this ability by finding each of the three cardinals' instruments\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE FRIENDS</strong> with over 50 unique characters! Whether you\u2019re looking to test your flying skills in a race with J\u00e9, the blue jay, or crack the case on the Eastern Bay\u2019s latest mystery with Sullivan, the snowy owl, there\u2019s always a new friend around the corner to speak to\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT ITEMS</strong> and use them to craft new furniture for your chicks when they come back home! A couple pebbles and twigs could be used to make a pebble-bath and branch-couch\u2026 or maybe you could even find a stranger willing to exchange these materials for a pet bumblebee!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/812975581b361b54167e9a28d9405827eb4522d1.jpg"},{"name":"Manny's Feathers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/a165642f0ed24cba0c688e5b0f7ae326d5ae714b.jpg"},{"name":"Maria's Feathers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/a165642f0ed24cba0c688e5b0f7ae326d5ae714b.jpg"},{"name":"Louka's Feathers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/a165642f0ed24cba0c688e5b0f7ae326d5ae714b.jpg"},{"name":"Victory!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/ade346b912b244825c610244992233dddb68641c.jpg"},{"name":"Mom Says Hi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/b16e553c3862646a5b22317fb783edd4ac3f12d6.jpg"},{"name":"Home Sweet Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/c02327cfd6c9f1b52895d71fbaaf9250a09e08ee.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Charm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/c8a919a37baaec9a721fbea934682862a1995c31.jpg"},{"name":"Whale Watching","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/076e6466c624bd57c7b11d8f951bf180f5cde4f9.jpg"},{"name":"Master Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3865990/d80724beb0acfbc77ff6bd92cf1de6dd80b26774.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865990?t=1760616007",